# Sparkle release pinned for the in-app updater.
#
# Fetched by scripts/fetch_sparkle.sh into .sparkle/ (gitignored), which
# supplies both the XCFramework Package.swift links against and the
# signing tools scripts/sign_appcast.sh calls. Taking the archive
# ourselves rather than letting SwiftPM resolve a remote package keeps
# the download under our control: SwiftPM's fetch has wedged silently for
# over half an hour in CI, whereas curl can retry and time out.
#
# The checksum is the one Sparkle's own Package.swift declares for this
# tag, so pinning it here preserves the verification SwiftPM was doing.
# When bumping, take the new value from that file rather than computing
# it locally — matching upstream's published digest is the point.
